        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_BIGA_NAME">
            <Text>Biga</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_BIGA_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Etruscan unique Antiquity Age cavalry unit. Replaces the Chariot. Faster and stronger than the unit it replaces, and stronger still on flat ground.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_BIGA_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>+4 [icon:COMBAT] Combat Strength on Flat terrain.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_BIGA_PREVIEW">
            <Text>Monteleone: +4 Combat Strength on Flat terrain.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_TYRRHENIAN_GALLEY_NAME">
            <Text>Tyrrhenian Galley</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_TYRRHENIAN_GALLEY_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Etruscan unique Antiquity Age naval unit. Replaces the Galley. Faster, sees further, and hits harder against other ships.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_TYRRHENIAN_GALLEY_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>+5 [icon:COMBAT] Combat Strength against Naval units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_TYRRHENIAN_GALLEY_PREVIEW">
            <Text>Thalassocracy: +5 Combat Strength against Naval units.</Text>
        </Row>
